          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 13 2025 18:21:48 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">AutoPlex<sup>®</sup> M4</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">With the touch of a single button, AutoPlex M4 mixes and transfers highly viscous bone cement for delivery in less than 60 seconds.<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup> You don't have to choose between efficiency and cement control. AutoPlex M4 is designed to help maximize both—giving you the automatic standard.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 02 2026 14:13:56 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgb(255,255,255)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "accordion": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-4a9aa678a2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-4a9aa678a2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 12 2025 14:22:25 GMT+0000",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 12 2025 14:28:27 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/accordion",
          "accordion_parsys1": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "accPosId": 1,
            "text": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-4a9aa678a2@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-4a9aa678a2@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 12 2025 14:22:56 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Cement-ready in less than 60 seconds<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reduces radiation to the user by up to 99.7% compared to a bone filler device<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Flexible extension tube with swivel joint allows cement injection in multiple positions&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easily connects to VertePort cement cannula&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Provides 11cc of deliverable cement<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Tactile feedback on delivery knob indicates 0.1cc of cement injection (0.8cc per 360˚ rotation)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Please see <a href=\"https://labeling.stryker.com/hcp/XHR/US/pthxr?keycode=04546540593108\">Instructions for Use (IFU)</a> for a complete listing of warnings, precautions and adverse events.</span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 02 2026 14:14:11 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
