              "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 13 2025 18:21:48 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">SpinePlex<sup>®</sup> bone cement</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">SpinePlex bone cement is a derivative of Simplex P bone cement and has an average working time of 10-12 minutes.<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup> It contains the same PMMA as Simplex P and is manufactured using the same proprietary process. Simplex P bone cement has proven through clinical testing to have high fatigue,<sup><a href=\"#references\">5</a></sup> compressive and flexural&nbsp;strengths<sup><a href=\"#references\">6</a></sup> and low creep.<sup><a href=\"#references\">7</a></sup></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 02 2026 14:15:22 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "backgroundColor": "rgb(237,238,236)",
              "textIsRich": "true"
